{"name":"Girl Crush","hex":"#d1c0dc","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"girl crush","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A strong but usually non-sexual fondness experienced by one woman or girl for another.","An aesthetic in idol girl groups characterized by themes of female empowerment, confidence, and an edgy visual and musical style, marketed toward female fans."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/girl_crush"}],"entries":[{"title":"Girl Crush","blocks":[{"text":"\"Girl Crush\" is a song written by Lori McKenna, Hillary Lindsey and Liz Rose, and performed by American country music group Little Big Town. It was released on December 15, 2014 as the second single from their sixth studio album, Pain Killer. The song received mostly positive reviews from music critics, won five music awards, including two Grammys, reaching number 3 on the Country Airplay charts and number one on the Hot Country Songs chart, ended up being the second-most played song of 2015 on the format, and is certified seven-times Platinum in the US."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/73/LBTGIRLCRUSHSINGLEART.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Girl_Crush","wikidata":"Q18663645"},{"title":"Girl Crush (manga)","blocks":[{"text":"Girl Crush  is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Midori Tayama. It began serialization on the Line Manga website under Shinchosha's Comic Nicola brand in November 2020. An anime television series adaptation produced by Enishiya has been announced."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3b/Girl_Crush_manga_volume_1_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Girl_Crush_(manga)","wikidata":"Q130479732"},{"title":"Womance","blocks":[{"text":"A womance is a close but non-sexual, non-romantic relationship between two or more women. It is an exceptionally tight affectional, homosocial female bonding relationship exceeding that of usual friendship, and is distinguished by a particularly high level of emotional intimacy."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Womance","wikidata":"Q8030769"},{"title":"Girl","blocks":[{"text":"A girl is a young female human, usually a child or an adolescent. While the term girl has other meanings, including young woman, daughter, or girlfriend regardless of age, the first meaning is the most common one."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Young_girl_smiling_in_sunshine_%282%29.jpg/330px-Young_girl_smiling_in_sunshine_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Girl","wikidata":"Q3031"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Womb_detail.jpg/330px-Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Womb_detail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Womb_detail.jpg/330px-Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Womb_detail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AViews_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Womb_detail.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Pietro_Magni_Reading_Girl_by_Roffe.jpeg/120px-Pietro_Magni_Reading_Girl_by_Roffe.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Pietro_Magni_Reading_Girl_by_Roffe.jpeg/250px-Pietro_Magni_Reading_Girl_by_Roffe.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Pietro_Magni_Reading_Girl_by_Roffe.jpeg/120px-Pietro_Magni_Reading_Girl_by_Roffe.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org